      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. It's just that in my experience, these things often feel like they're being caused by tiny, hidden elements—like people intentionally acting in bad faith or just being generally malicious to undermine us. How do I write the contract so that it addresses those kinds of \"bad faith\" actors or people acting in a way that feels almost like they're trying to sabotage the partnership from the inside?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
